WEBVTT

00:04:28.636 --> 00:04:30.036
but not removed.

00:04:30.836 --> 00:04:32.116
In the third option --

00:04:32.116 --> 00:04:33.556
it's similar to the second --

00:04:33.556 --> 00:04:35.756
you're going to continue
to go on your trip,

00:04:35.796 --> 00:04:38.036
but in this case,
you're going to pay somebody

00:04:38.036 --> 00:04:40.196
to physically remove
three tonnes of carbon

00:04:40.236 --> 00:04:42.356
from the atmosphere on your behalf.

00:04:42.676 --> 00:04:46.596
And this type of payment,
called a carbon-removal offset,

00:04:46.636 --> 00:04:50.916
could theoretically scale
from individual, to organizational,

00:04:50.916 --> 00:04:53.516
to global net-zero outcomes.

00:04:53.516 --> 00:04:54.716
But in order to do so,

00:04:54.756 --> 00:04:59.516
it's going to have to have significant
technological advances and breakthroughs

00:04:59.556 --> 00:05:01.236
to achieve the scale necessary.